  <item>
    <title>#25 再听风骚律师配乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63317c299186d4e4c46a0570</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63317c299186d4e4c46a0570</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Sep 2022 10:17:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>♪ INTRO：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;“It's all good, man”</span></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;历时7年，风骚律师完结落下帷幕，风骚律师的艺术性不仅在画面，也体现在配乐部分，再一次，我们一起用耳朵听听 Better Call Saul</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>♪ SONGLIST：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Address Unknown - The Ink Spots</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S1E01 全剧开场曲，伴随着音乐，镜头里Gene蓦然抬头</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> Better Call Saul Main Title Theme - Better Call Saul</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>BCS主题曲 伴随着Saul不断地录像带播放，每一季画质音质情况越来越差</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> Shared Smoke - DAVE PORTER</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S1E01 Jimmy与Kim第一次分享一支烟</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> Sugar Town - Nancy Sinatra</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S3E01 Gene日常制作甜品，看似安逸稳定的生活，差点被小偷和警察撞破</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> Something Stupid- Lola Marsh</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S4E07 一边是Kim新律所的律师工作，一边是Saul电信公司的卖手机工作</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S5E09 一边是Kim焦急等待，一边是Saul沙漠逃生</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> Perfect Day - Harry Nilsson</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S6E09 Kim因为Howard的死内疚不已，选择离开Saul</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> Track 25 - DAVE PORTER</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>S6E13 故事的最后，Saul在监狱Kim最后一次分享一支烟，应该说是Jimmy，Goodbye Saul</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> Better Call Saul End Credits - DAVE PORTER</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>BCS片尾曲 最终集的标题是《Saul Gone》，如果按Saul Goodman的谐音梗的话，应该是It’s all gone的意思，结局时Jimmy回来了，而Saul留下了传奇</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><span>• &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> Better Call Saul Main Title Theme(full) - Better Call Saul</span></p><span></span><p><u><em><span>最后一次听听完整的主题曲</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「Saul Gone」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpixNvaM-iVqPVfb72oLnvquV3N6.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/limtqP8TFszkJ_bK796JAeBhTKUM.m4a" length="23164434" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnWm5OOExGdDQyUlZXb1dIOTZYTXQ4YVJCTkEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#24 没有乐夏的夏天原来快过完了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6320b30ff3d15f16f4cc33eb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6320b30ff3d15f16f4cc33eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Sep 2022 16:42:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>♪ INTRO：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>• “夏天原来快过完了”</span></p><span></span><p><span>• 最近因为工作出差到北方，原来北方真的很遵守二十四节气，真的在立秋之后就慢慢有秋天的感觉，温度相比热度满满的南方舒适很多，后知后觉夏天快过完了</span></p><span></span><p><span>• 今年的夏天又热又长，翻起音乐软件突然发现隐藏在角落里，有一个很久没打开的歌单《乐队的夏天合集》，才发现</span></p><span></span><p><span>• “原来今年夏天又是一个没有乐夏的夏天”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>「啊不好意思呐，南方的夏天远未结束...」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuxrjzUr2DEju2fBnQuCpibXu4K.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
